    "GRWTSK.NumberTheory.ArithmeticAlgebraicGeometryDiophantineGeometry.FreyPrimePowerDenominator.prime_power_factor_of_denominator_prime": "∀ (P : FreyPackage) {q : Nat}\n  (hqPrime : Nat.Prime q) (hqbad : (q : Int) ∣ P.a * P.b * P.c) (hqodd : 2 < q)\n  (hqden : q ∣ P.freyCurve.j.den),\n  P.p ≤ padicValNat q P.freyCurve.j.den ∧\n    ∃ k : Nat, 0 < k ∧ P.freyCurve.j.den = q ^ P.p * k ∧\n      q ^ P.p ≤ P.freyCurve.j.den"
  },
